<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Driver Management & Performance</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Total lifecycle management for your frontline force, ensuring safety compliance, 
            performance accountability, and efficient financial disbursements.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Regulatory & Safety Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            The Driver Management module maintains a secure digital record for every driver, 
            centrally tracking license expiration, Professional Driving Permits (PDP), 
            and required medical examinations. Automated alerts notify management 
            well in advance of document expiration, preventing costly compliance 
            breaches and ensuring that only authorized personnel are assigned to 
            active trips.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integrated incident logs and training records provide a comprehensive view of 
            driver history, supporting organizational commitment to OSHA and ISO 39001 safety 
            standards.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Performance Scoring & Accountability</h2>
        <p>
            Incentivize excellence through data-driven driver performance scoring. The system 
            aggregates data from across the fleet—On-Time Delivery rates, fuel efficiency, 
            speed violations, and customer feedback—to generate an authoritative 
            performance rating for every driver. This transparency fosters professional 
            pride and provides management with the evidence needed for performance 
            reviews and incentive payouts.
        </p>
        <p>
            Live trip acceptance and progress tracking via the mobile app ensures that 
            drivers are always aligned with the central dispatch, providing 
            instant feedback on route status and delivery success.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Integrated Financial Disbursements</h2>
        <p>
            Simplify the management of driver expenses and advances. Our native integration with 
            the EcoCash platform allows for the instant disbursement of trip advances 
            and expense claims directly to a driver's mobile wallet. This eliminates 
            the security risks and administrative overhead associated with cash 
            handling, allowing your drivers to remain focused on the road while 
            maintaining perfect financial accountability within the ERP.
        </p>
        <p>
            Driver shift scheduling and rest-time monitoring ensure that your team remains 
            alert and compliant with road safety regulations, protecting both 
            your staff and your organizational reputation.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

